    },
    {
        "text": "Three shooting stars illuminate the deep passageway."
    },
    {
        "text": "The bishop is horrified. But because it has neither lungs nor vocal tracts, this thundering sound is as close as it gets to a scream for its current body."
    },
    {
        "text": "Amidst the debris and crumbling walls, the monster's bloated, dying form sprawls across much of the karst cave. Once emanating a strange, eerie beauty, its bizarre body now begins to stiffen in dread as it faces impending doom."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
